1	//! Error type for the sw-launch CLI.
2	//!
3	//! Each variant carries a stable error code from `docs/design.md`'s
4	//! "Validation rules" / "Error code stability" sections. New
5	//! variants are appended; existing codes never change meaning.
6	//!
7	//! Schema-validation codes E0001..E0027 are reserved for the
8	//! `validate` module (step 005); this enum currently models only
9	//! the runtime-shaped errors the scaffold needs.
10	
11	use std::fmt;
12	
